  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). Pair: ⟦{傷|いた}める→傷める：02098_itameru⟧ (transitive). Pattern: X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{傷|いた}む.\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- ⟦{痛|いた}む→痛む：03008_itamu⟧ - to hurt, to ache\n- {傷|いた}む - to be damaged, to spoil (this entry)\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates a current state of being damaged/spoiled.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{髪|かみ}→髪：02196_kami⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{傷|いた}む (hair becomes damaged)\n- ⟦{食|た}べ{物|もの}→食べ物：02890_tabemono⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{傷|いた}む (food spoils)\n- {傷|いた}みやすい (easily damaged/perishable)",
